# vLLM MoE CPU Offload RFC ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** vLLM RFC for dynamic expert offload to CPU with a hot subset in GPU memory.

**LEONES status:** P2; design evidence, not an implementation target.

## Summary

The RFC describes CPU as the source of truth for expert weights while selected experts are copied to GPU as needed.

## ODS fit

This is strategically important because it points toward native support in a major inference engine. ODS should track implementation progress and prefer an upstream mature feature over maintaining an independent fork when practical.